Conversation Meyehind.Correct.Text|{{emote|*You see Meyehind's body relax a bit.*}}

That's right, kendren.

It's naught to do with the case anyway. Only cold tradition and the cold heart that keeps it.

items.old_value:
{{emote|*Ihr seht, wie sich Meyehinds Körper etwas entspannt.*}}

